### ===============================
### 1. 회원가입 / 인증 (UserController)
### ===============================

### 1-1. 이메일 중복 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/check-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 1-2. 이메일 인증코드 발송
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/email/verify-request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 1-3. 이메일 인증코드 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/email/verify-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "470545"
}

### 1-4. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "userName": "홍길동",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1234-5678",
  "token": "token"
}

### 1-5. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 1-6. 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
X-User-Id: 1

### 1-7. 이메일 찾기
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/find-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "홍길동",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 1-8. 비밀번호 재설정 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/password/reset-request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 1-9. 비밀번호 재설정 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/password/reset-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token",
  "password": "NewPassword1234!"
}

### 1-10. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "NewPassword1234!"
}


### ===============================
### 2. 휴면/탈퇴 복구 (UserController)
### ===============================

### 2-1. 탈퇴 복구
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reactive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reactiveToken": "여기에_reactiveToken_입력"
}

### 2-2. 휴면 해제 - 인증코드 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reactivate/email-verify-request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 2-3. 휴면 해제 - 인증코드 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reactivate/email-verify-confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}


### ===============================
### 3. OAuth 로그인 (UserController)
### ===============================

### 3-1. Google OAuth 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/oauth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "여기에_google_authorization_code_입력"
}


